 "notes": "All 26 races called. Caveats: (1) Several pages (Axios, Indiana Capital Chronicle) returned HTTP 403 to the page fetcher, so Indiana winners other than IN-5 and the IN-5 call rest on web-search excerpts of the Indiana Capital Chronicle/States Newsroom article citing AP (it lists Mrvan, Yakym, Stutzman, Baird, Shreve, Carson, Messmer, Houchin as re-elected; 270toWin also shows all 9 called, 6 R / 3 D). (2) Illinois winners come from the NBC Chicago results page (opened directly), which omitted IL-13; IL-13 (Budzinski, AP call) comes from a St. Louis Public Radio search excerpt. (3) The NBC Chicago article says Illinois sends 'six freshman members', but I count only five new winners (IL-2, 4, 7, 8, 9); unresolved discrepancy. (4) Backgrounds for La Shawn Ford (state rep), Biss (Evanston mayor) and Donna Miller (Cook County commissioner) come from search excerpts; Melissa Bean's background was not confirmed from a source and is left generic. District numbers checked against 2026 sources; no Illinois or Indiana redistricting change was observed in these sources."
